name: ['Avacyn, Angel of Hope', 'Chalice of the Void', 'Darkmoss Bridge', 'Drossforge Bridge', 'Glimpse the Unthinkable', "Go-Shintai of Life's Origin", 'Goldmire Bridge', 'Laelia, the Blade Reforged', 'Mistvault Bridge', "Night of Souls' Betrayal", 'Ophiomancer', 'Phyrexian Metamorph', 'Razortide Bridge', 'Retrofitter Foundry', 'Rustvale Bridge', 'Silverbluff Bridge', 'Slagwoods Bridge', 'Tanglepool Bridge', 'Tarmogoyf', 'Thornglint Bridge']
