text: ["({U/P} can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)\\nYou may have Phyrexian Metamorph enter the battlefield as a copy of any artifact or creature on the battlefield, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types.", 'All creatures get -1/-1.', 'At the beginning of each upkeep, if you control no Snakes, create a 1/1 black Snake creature token with deathtouch.', 'Chalice of the Void enters the battlefield with X charge counters on it.\\nWhenever a player casts a spell with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Chalice of the Void, counter that spell.', 'Darkmoss Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.', 'Drossforge Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Flying, vigilance, indestructible\\nOther permanents you control have indestructible.', 'Goldmire Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', 'Haste\\nWhenever Laelia, the Blade Reforged attacks, exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn.\\nWhenever one or more cards are put into exile from your library and/or your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on Laelia.', 'Mistvault Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Razortide Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Rustvale Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Silverbluff Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', 'Slagwoods Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Tanglepool Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'Target player mills ten cards.', "Tarmogoyf's power is equal to the number of card types among cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", 'Thornglint Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nIndestructible\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', '{3}: Untap Retrofitter Foundry.\\n{2}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a Servo: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Thopter: Create a 4/4 colorless Construct artifact creature token.', "{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Return target enchantment card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nWhenever Go-Shintai of Life's Origin or another nontoken Shrine enters the battlefield under your control, create a 1/1 colorless Shrine enchantment creature token."]
